spans.s:
सम्-आ-√ लभ् Ā. -लभते, to take hold of seize, touch, ŚBr. &c.;
to stroke, handle, MBh.;
to obtain, acquire, Hit. (v.l.);
to rub, anoint, smear over, Kāv.; Kathās.; Suśr.

सम्-आ-√ लम्ब् Ā. -लम्बते, to hang on, cling to (acc.), MBh.; Rājat.;
to lean on, depend on, trust to (acc.), Kathās.;
to take to (acc.), Cat.;
to take hold of, seize, grasp, Kum.; Kathās.;
to have recourse to, assume, R.; Mṛcch.; Bhaṭṭ.;
to acquire, obtain, appropriate, Hit. (v.l.);
to fall to the lot of (loc.), ib. :
Caus. लम्बयति, to cause to hang or rest, suspend to (loc.), Pañcat.

सम्-आ-√ लुड् Caus. -लोडयति, to stir up, stir in, mix together, mingle with (instr.), MBh.; Suśr.; AgP.;
to agitate, disturb, confuse, MBh.;
to rummage, investigate, Cat.
